       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NESTPGM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MSG   PIC X(20).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL 'INNERPGM' USING WS-MSG.
           STOP RUN.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INNERPGM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-MSG   PIC X(20).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-MSG.
           MOVE 'FROM THE INNER' TO LK-MSG.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM INNERPGM.
       END PROGRAM NESTPGM.
